# GRCh38/hg38 core regions excluded from XCI inference.
# BED coordinates are 0-based, half-open.
# PAR1/PAR2 are excluded because they are pseudoautosomal rather than subject
# to canonical XCI. XIST is excluded from the default inference because its
# promoter methylation relationship is reversed relative to standard X-linked
# CpG islands.
chrX	10000	2781479	PAR1
chrX	155701382	156030895	PAR2
chrX	73820655	73852714	XIST
